    "The number is average forecast deviation from measured temperature, not an integration fault. Ratings are practical guidance. Color requires at least 20 comparisons. Green also requires beating the no-change benchmark.": "Arv on keskmine prognoosi kõrvalekalle, mitte viga. Juhis; värv vajab 20 võrdlust, roheline ka muutumatust võrdlusest paremat tulemust.",
